   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1  Existence of institutional review identifying  gaps &amp; opportunities across various policies.
1.2 A SBMP document adopted as a policy instrument to mainstream for mainstreaming conservation and sustainable use of biodiversity and ecosystems into sub-national and sectoral development in Sarawak 
1.3 Existence of gender and people responsive strategies and actions in the Sarawak Biodiversity Master Plan.

2.1 Existence of a specific mechanism to rationalize and clarify mandate of sub-national institutions across sector and government functions for conservation and sustainable use of biodiversity and ecosystems.

3.1 Percentage of capacity development scores of key biodiversity institutions improved.

4.1 Percentage of project budget spent</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2021">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 No Policy, Institutional and Legal review and analysis.
1.2 No Sarawak Biodiversity Master Plan.
1.3 Existence of gender and people responsive strategies and actions in the Sarawak Biodiversity Master Plan.

2.1 No specific mechanism to rationalize and clarify mandate of sub-national institutions across sector and government functions for conservation and sustainable use of biodiversity and ecosystems.

3.1 Zero percentage of capacity development scores of key biodiversity institutions improved.

4.1 Zero Percentage of project budget spent.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
